  m_text: "Hydrangea Tips\n\n1. Plant hydrangeas in well-draining soil and place
    them where they get morning sun and afternoon shade.\n\n2. Water deeply a few
    times per week, keeping the soil consistently moist\u2014hydrangeas wilt quickly
    if too dry.\n\n3. Fertilize in spring with a balanced or hydrangea-specific fertilizer,
    and prune according to the type (old-wood vs. new-wood bloomers).\n\nIf you'd
    like, I can also give you a si"
