  m_text: "Cabbage Tips \n\n1. Plant cabbage in full sun with fertile, well-draining
    soil, and space plants well to allow large heads to form.\n\n2. Keep soil consistently
    moist with regular watering and mulch to help retain moisture and control weeds.\n\n3.
    Feed with a nitrogen-rich fertilizer during early growth and protect from pests
    like cabbage worms using row covers if needed."
